 This repository is a fork of [lucasprag/vscode-teamdocs](https://github.com/lucasprag/vscode-teamdocs),
 published as `TobiasHochguertel.teamdocs`.
 
+### What this fork adds
+
+- **Copy Path / Copy Relative Path** — context-menu commands on the Team Docs explorer
+  (the feature this fork started for).
+- **Rendered-preview fallback** — still works when `markdown.showPreview` is unavailable.
+- **Dual-registry publishing** — automated releases to Open VSX as `TobiasHochguertel.teamdocs`
+  (VS Code Marketplace re-enables once Microsoft's publish rate-limit is resolved).
+- **Fork infrastructure** — daily upstream sync, Dependabot → `.patch` automation, REUSE
+  compliance, and CI-built `.vsix` artifacts.
+
 - **`dev.patch` is the develop branch.** All fork work lands here: new files as direct commits,
   changes to upstream files as `.patch` files under `.github/patches/` (applied in alphabetical order).
